Componenti di terze parti / Third-party components
Le librerie di terze parti incluse (ad esempio Bootstrap, JSZip, Chart.js,
jsPDF) e le dipendenze npm e Rust restano soggette alle rispettive licenze,
riportate nei loro file e nello SBOM allegato a ogni Release.
Bundled third-party libraries (e.g. Bootstrap, JSZip, Chart.js, jsPDF) and the
npm and Rust dependencies remain under their own licenses, included in their
files and listed in the SBOM attached to every Release.
